# ::tok Firstly, I bought it with great expectations, thinking that the Le brand wouldn't be too bad. After receiving it, I thought the packaging was okay, and the size was decent. However, one box was mostly soft, which you can't tell from the outside, you have to feel it. When eaten, it had no taste at all, bland and flavorless. When bitten into, the fruit flesh was a dark yellow, indicating it was bad. They mixed good and bad ones for sale, and less than a third were edible. I advise everyone not to buy it. It's not cheap, and the quality is too poor!
