# ::tok Speaking of the packaging, it was just wrapped in a few layers of cling film, without any bubble wrap inside. When I opened it, all the parts were just lying in the empty box. Thankfully, the quality of the toy is good and there were no broken parts. However, it's much smaller than I imagined. Since it's not battery-operated, it often derails when pushed by hand. I feel that the gap on both sides of the track is too large, the design is unreasonable.
